        "eyebrow": "Craft & engineering",
        "heading": "Precision you can <em>hold</em>.",
        "text": "<p>Each pan begins as layers of metal — titanium, a triple aluminium core and two grades of stainless steel — forged under pressure into a single body. The LavaCell™ surface is laser-etched hexagon by hexagon, so every peak sits at the same height and every valley holds the same film of oil.</p><p>The handle is forged, the rim flared for a clean pour, and every piece is checked for flatness before it is packed.</p>",
